## Repository Structure

```
RB1_Project/
├── README.md
├── scripts/
│   ├── step1_dna_sequence.py      — DNA retrieval from NCBI
│   ├── step2_dna_to_mrna.py       — T→U mRNA conversion
│   ├── step3_blast_protein.py     — protein sequence + BLAST summary
│   ├── step4_alphafold2.ipynb     — AlphaFold2 workflow + report
│   └── step5_gnina_docking.ipynb  — GNINA docking results + summary
├── outputs/
│   ├── RB1_DNA.fasta              — DNA sequence (from NCBI Nucleotide)
│   ├── RB1_mRNA.fasta             — mRNA (T→U converted)
│   ├── RB1_protein.fasta          — protein sequence (NP_000312.2)
│   ├── RB1_BLAST_results.txt      — BLAST search summary
│   ├── AlphaFold2_report.txt      — pLDDT + PAE analysis report
│   ├── docking_log.txt            — GNINA docking log (all 9 poses)
│   └── docking_output.sdf         — GNINA docked poses (SDF format)
└── figures/
    ├── plddt.png                  — ColabFold pLDDT per-residue plot
    ├── pae.png                    — PAE heatmap (5 models)
    ├── coverage.png               — MSA sequence coverage plot
    ├── rcsb_structure.png         — 3D structure screenshot (RCSB viewer)
    └── docking_molstar.png        — docking visualization (Molstar)
```

